# ==============================================================================
# ENQUEbet Project Environment Configuration Root Guide
# ==============================================================================
# This repository is a decoupled full-stack architecture:
# - Backend (Django / Daphne / PostgreSQL / Redis) -> backend/.env
# - Frontend (Next.js / TypeScript / Tailwind)     -> frontend/.env.local
#
# Please see the subproject templates for exact variable definitions:
#   Backend template:  backend/.env.example
#   Frontend template: frontend/.env.example
#
# Complete deployment and configuration guide:
#   docs/deployment/ENVIRONMENT_CONFIGURATION.md
# ==============================================================================
